WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.156 --> 00:00:01.085
Health.

00:00:01.226 --> 00:00:02.603
Sounds serious, doesn’t it?

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.377
Somehow we’ve convinced ourselves

00:00:04.402 --> 00:00:07.622
that being healthy is some
unrealistic thing reserved for the

00:00:07.647 --> 00:00:10.644
‘6am running-before-work’
overachievers.

00:00:10.669 --> 00:00:12.012
But that’s just not true.

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.147
Health is something
we can all have.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.250
The trick is embracing
it little by little.

00:00:16.797 --> 00:00:19.219
And Manulife Vitality
can help you start.

00:00:19.314 --> 00:00:21.388
It’s a program built
with your health in mind.

00:00:21.413 --> 00:00:23.310
And it helps you make
little changes today

00:00:23.335 --> 00:00:25.626
that will have a real effect
on your health tomorrow.

00:00:25.713 --> 00:00:28.028
And not only will it help
improve your lifestyle,

00:00:28.053 --> 00:00:31.198
you’ll also earn rewards for the
healthy choices you make along the way.

00:00:32.403 --> 00:00:33.896
So, the healthier you become,

00:00:33.921 --> 00:00:35.402
the more money you can save.

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:38.338
Live healthy.
Earn rewards. Simple.

00:00:38.597 --> 00:00:40.207
Manulife Vitality.

00:00:40.289 --> 00:00:43.510
The first step towards a healthier
you that’s actually achievable.

00:00:43.535 --> 00:00:47.314
To learn more visit
Manulife.ca/Vitality

